      "created_at": "2025-12-31T16:48:19.729Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The print format set in POS Profile only applies when creating invoices through the POS interface, not when creating Sales Invoices directly from the Sales Invoice form.</p>\n<p>You can try using Global default: Set your print format as “Default” in Print Format settings</p>\n<p>OR</p>\n<p>Create invoices through the POS screen instead of Sales Invoice form</p>",
